<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>궤도요소 기반 위성 통과 시뮬레이터 - 적분 시각화</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #080b13;
      --panel: rgba(18, 24, 38, 0.88);
      --panel-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      --text: #e8eefc;
      --muted: #9fb0d0;
      --accent: #75d6ff;
      --accent-2: #9cffb0;
      --warn: #ffcf70;
      --danger: #ff7a7a;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #11182a 0%, var(--bg) 60%, #02040a 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    #app {
      position: relative;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
    }

    canvas.webgl {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    .panel {
      position: absolute;
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      user-select: none;
      resize: both;
      overflow: auto;
      min-width: 260px;
      min-height: 130px;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .panel.dragging {
      opacity: 0.96;
      cursor: grabbing;
      z-index: 30;
    }

    .drag-handle { cursor: grab; }

    .panel-header,
    .observer-head,
    .spectrum-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .panel-header h2,
    .observer-head h2,
    .spectrum-head h2 { margin: 0; }

    .close-panel {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      padding: 0;
      border-radius: 9px;
      line-height: 1;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }

    .panel-dock {
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      top: 18px;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(18, 24, 38, 0.78);
      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      z-index: 40;
    }

    .dock-btn {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .dock-btn.hidden-panel {
      background: rgba(117, 214, 255, 0.16);
      border-color: rgba(117, 214, 255, 0.32);
    }

    .panel.collapsed { display: none; }

    .title-panel {
      top: 18px;
      left: 18px;
      width: min(520px, calc(100vw - 36px));
      min-height: 135px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
    }

    .title-panel h1 {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: 21px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .title-panel p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .controls {
      left: 18px;
      bottom: 18px;
      width: 470px;
      min-width: 430px;
      min-height: 360px;
      max-height: min(72vh, 680px);
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .controls h2,
    .status h2,
    .graph-panel h2,
    .spectrum-panel h2,
    .observer-panel h2 {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .control-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 112px minmax(130px, 1fr) 88px 74px;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin: 10px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .control-row label { color: var(--muted); }
    .control-row input[type="range"] { width: 100%; min-width: 0; accent-color: var(--accent); }

    .control-row input[type="number"] {
      width: 88px;
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 7px 8px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      color: var(--text);
      font: inherit;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      outline: none;
    }

    input[type="number"]:focus {
      border-color: rgba(117, 214, 255, 0.62);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(117, 214, 255, 0.15);
    }

    .value {
      text-align: right;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .button-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    button {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      color: var(--text);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    button:hover { background: rgba(117, 214, 255, 0.16); }

    .status {
      top: 18px;
      right: 18px;
      width: 330px;
      min-height: 360px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .stat-grid { display: grid; gap: 8px; }

    .stat {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .stat span:first-child { color: var(--muted); }
    .stat span:last-child { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; text-align: right; }
    .visible { color: var(--accent-2); font-weight: 800; }
    .hidden { color: var(--danger); font-weight: 800; }

    .observer-panel {
      left: 430px;
      top: 190px;
      width: 420px;
      min-width: 340px;
      min-height: 350px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .spectrum-panel {
      left: 430px;
      bottom: 18px;
      width: min(560px, calc(100vw - 940px));
      min-width: 420px;
      min-height: 330px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .graph-panel {
      right: 18px;
      bottom: 18px;
      width: min(470px, calc(100vw - 440px));
      min-width: 320px;
      min-height: 300px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .analysis-view {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 120;
      display: block;
      overflow: auto;
      padding: 22px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(117, 214, 255, 0.12), transparent 34%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(156, 255, 176, 0.10), transparent 38%),
        rgba(4, 7, 14, 0.96);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    }

    .analysis-view.hidden-view { display: none; }

    .analysis-page {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100vw - 44px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .analysis-page-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }

    .analysis-page-header h2 {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: 22px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .analysis-page-header p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .analysis-back-btn {
      white-space: nowrap;
      padding: 11px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .analysis-page-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 0.9fr) minmax(420px, 1.35fr);
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .analysis-card {
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.30);
    }

    .analysis-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .analysis-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .analysis-actions {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .analysis-actions button { font-size: 12px; }


    .event-analysis-box {
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding-top: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    }

    .event-analysis-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .event-select-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .event-analysis-actions {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .event-analysis-actions button { font-size: 12px; }

    #eventSignalGraph {
      width: 100%;
      height: clamp(300px, 42vh, 520px);
      display: block;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(2, 5, 12, 0.62);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .event-analysis-text {
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(117, 214, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(117, 214, 255, 0.14);
      color: #dff7ff;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      white-space: pre-line;
    }


    .auto-experiment-card {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .auto-experiment-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .auto-experiment-head p {
      margin: 4px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .auto-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .auto-results-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
      background: rgba(2, 5, 12, 0.42);
    }

    .auto-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      min-width: 860px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .auto-table th,
    .auto-table td {
      padding: 8px 9px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      text-align: right;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    .auto-table th:first-child,
    .auto-table td:first-child,
    .auto-table th:nth-child(2),
    .auto-table td:nth-child(2) {
      text-align: left;
    }

    .auto-table th {
      color: #ffffff;
      background: rgba(117, 214, 255, 0.10);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
    }

    .auto-table td {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .auto-summary {
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(255, 207, 112, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 207, 112, 0.18);
      color: #ffe8ad;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      white-space: pre-line;
    }


    .auto-view-btn {
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .replay-badge {
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      top: 70px;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      z-index: 55;
      padding: 9px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 207, 112, 0.16);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 207, 112, 0.32);
      color: #ffe8ad;
      font-size: 12px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      display: none;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .replay-badge.visible { display: block; }

    .calculus-note {
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 207, 112, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 207, 112, 0.18);
      color: #ffe8ad;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .integral-mini {
      margin-top: 10px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .integral-bar-shell {
      height: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    }

    .integral-bar-fill {
      width: 0%;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(117,214,255,0.75), rgba(255,207,112,0.90));
      transition: width 0.18s ease;
    }


    .preset-box {
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding-top: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    }

    .preset-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .preset-input-row,
    .preset-select-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .preset-input-row input,
    .preset-select-row select {
      min-width: 0;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
      color: var(--text);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      font: inherit;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .preset-select-row select option { color: #111827; }

    .preset-actions {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .preset-actions button,
    .preset-input-row button,
    .preset-select-row button { font-size: 12px; }

    .mini-note {
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    #observerView,
    #signalGraph,
    #spectrumGraph {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(2, 5, 12, 0.62);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    #observerView {
      height: clamp(210px, calc(100% - 118px), 520px);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(15, 27, 48, 0.92), rgba(2, 5, 12, 0.95));
    }

    #signalGraph { height: clamp(170px, calc(100% - 86px), 520px); }
    #spectrumGraph { height: clamp(190px, calc(100% - 118px), 540px); }

    .switch-wrap {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .switch {
      position: relative;
      width: 58px;
      height: 28px;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .switch input { opacity: 0; width: 0; height: 0; }

    .slider-switch {
      position: absolute;
      cursor: pointer;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.13);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
      border-radius: 999px;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .slider-switch:before {
      position: absolute;
      content: "";
      height: 20px;
      width: 20px;
      left: 4px;
      top: 3px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transition: 0.2s;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(117,214,255,0.55);
    }

    .switch input:checked + .slider-switch:before {
      transform: translateX(28px);
      background: var(--warn);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255,207,112,0.55);
    }

    .legend {
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .formula {
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(117, 214, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(117, 214, 255, 0.14);
      color: #dff7ff;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1280px) {
      .spectrum-panel { left: auto; right: 18px; bottom: 250px; width: 470px; min-width: 320px; }
      .observer-panel { left: 18px; top: 190px; width: 390px; }
    }


    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .control-row {
        grid-template-columns: 94px 1fr 70px;
        row-gap: 6px;
      }
      .control-row input[type="number"] {
        grid-column: 2 / 3;
        grid-row: 2;
        width: 100%;
      }
      .control-row .value {
        grid-column: 3 / 4;
        grid-row: 2;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      body { overflow: auto; }
      #app { min-height: 1580px; }
      canvas.webgl { height: 100vh; }
      .title-panel, .controls, .status, .graph-panel, .spectrum-panel, .observer-panel {
        position: relative;
        left: auto;
        right: auto;
        top: auto;
        bottom: auto;
        width: calc(100vw - 32px);
        min-width: 0;
        margin: 16px;
      }
      .title-panel { margin-top: 16px; }
      .controls { max-height: none; min-width: 0; }
      .control-row {
        grid-template-columns: 94px minmax(110px, 1fr) 82px 64px;
        gap: 7px;
      }
      .control-row input[type="number"] { width: 82px; padding: 6px 7px; }
      .value { font-size: 12px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .analysis-view { padding: 14px; }
      .analysis-page { width: calc(100vw - 28px); }
      .analysis-page-header { flex-direction: column; }
      .analysis-page-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .analysis-back-btn { width: 100%; }
    }

  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div id="app">
    <canvas class="webgl" id="scene"></canvas>

    <nav class="panel-dock" id="panelDock" aria-label="패널 소환 버튼">
      <button class="dock-btn" data-target="titlePanel">설명</button>
      <button class="dock-btn" data-target="controlsPanel">조절</button>
      <button class="dock-btn" data-target="statusPanel">상태</button>
      <button class="dock-btn" data-target="observerPanel">관측자</button>
      <button class="dock-btn" data-target="spectrumPanel">SDR</button>
      <button class="dock-btn" data-target="graphPanel">그래프</button>
      <button class="dock-btn" id="openAnalysisView" type="button">분석 화면</button>
    </nav>

    <div class="replay-badge" id="replayBadge">자동 탐색 결과 재생 중</div>

    <section class="panel title-panel" id="titlePanel" data-panel-name="설명">
      <div class="drag-handle">
        <h1>궤도요소 기반 위성 통과 시뮬레이터</h1>
      </div>
      <p>
        지구 자전과 케플러 궤도요소를 반영하여 위성의 3차원 위치를 계산합니다.
        관측자 기준 고도각, 거리, 도플러 이동, 수신 신호 세기와 누적 수신량을 실시간으로 표시하고, 분석 데이터를 CSV/JSON으로 내보낼 수 있습니다. 장반경은 최대 500,000 km까지 확장되었습니다. WASD 전역 카메라 이동, 카메라 이동속도, 초고속 시간 배속 조절을 지원합니다.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel controls" id="controlsPanel" data-panel-name="조절">
      <div class="panel-header drag-handle">
        <h2>조절 슬라이더</h2>
        <button class="close-panel" data-close="controlsPanel">×</button>
      </div>

      <div class="control-row"><label for="semiMajor">장반경 a</label><input id="semiMajor" type="range" min="6700" max="500000" step="500" value="7200" /><input id="semiMajorNumber" type="number" min="6700" max="500000" step="500" value="7200" aria-label="장반경 a 숫자 입력" /><div class="value" id="semiMajorValue"></div></div>
      <div class="control-row"><label for="eccentricity">이심률 e</label><input id="eccentricity" type="range" min="0" max="0.75" step="0.01" value="0.02" /><input id="eccentricityNumber" type="number" min="0" max="0.75" step="0.01" value="0.02" aria-label="이심률 e 숫자 입력" /><div class="value" id="eccentricityValue"></div></div>
      <div class="control-row"><label for="inclination">경사각 i</label><input id="inclination" type="range" min="0" max="120" step="1" value="98" /><input id="inclinationNumber" type="number" min="0" max="120" step="1" value="98" aria-label="경사각 i 숫자 입력" /><div class="value" id="inclinationValue"></div></div>
      <div class="control-row"><label for="raan">승교점 Ω</label><input id="raan" type="range" min="0" max="360" step="1" value="35" /><input id="raanNumber" type="number" min="0" max="360" step="1" value="35" aria-label="승교점 Ω 숫자 입력" /><div class="value" id="raanValue"></div></div>
      <div class="control-row"><label for="argPerigee">근지점 ω</label><input id="argPerigee" type="range" min="0" max="360" step="1" value="40" /><input id="argPerigeeNumber" type="number" min="0" max="360" step="1" value="40" aria-label="근지점 ω 숫자 입력" /><div class="value" id="argPerigeeValue"></div></div>
